          "label": "3",
          "value": "k3"
        }
      ],
      "help": "Drafted tokens per step. The drafter emits exactly 5 per pass, so upstream allows 5 or fewer (or a multiple of 5); 7 crashes on first generation. k=5 measured about 24 percent faster than k=3 (upstream).",
